 "contentHtml": "<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\" class=\"bbc_size\"><strong>QB Mod Browser and Mod Manager - QBMBAMM</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/b1owC02.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" class=\"bbc_img resized\"><br><br><a href=\"https://github.com/theRoastSuckling/QBMBAMM/releases/latest/download/QBMBAMM-Windows.zip\" class=\"bbc_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 22pt;\" class=\"bbc_size\">DOWNLOAD</span></strong><br><strong><span style=\"font-size: 22pt;\" class=\"bbc_size\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/theRoastSuckling/QBMBAMM?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=whit\" alt=\"\" class=\"bbc_img\"></span></strong></a> <br><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\" class=\"bbc_size\">Source code</span><br><a href=\"https://github.com/theRoastSuckling/QBMBAMM\" class=\"bbc_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/REPO-QBMBAMM-181717?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" class=\"bbc_img\"></a><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 15pt;\" class=\"bbc_size\"><strong>Installation</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\" class=\"bbc_size\">unzip the archive and run the .exe</span><br>SmartScreen will warn you because the .exe is unsigned, press \"More info\" -&gt; \"Run anyway\"<br><sub>The .exe is built from public source code automatically via a <a href=\"https://github.com/theRoastSuckling/QBMBAMM/actions/workflows/release.yml\" class=\"bbc_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">github action</a><br>You can also build the exe yourself by downloading the source code and running build-and-run-server.bat</sub><br><br></div><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\" class=\"bbc_size\"><strong>QBMBAMM provides a modern, all-in-one UI experience for Starsector modded gameplay.</strong></span><br><br><table class=\"bbc_table\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Mod browsing</strong></td><td>Search, sorting of many kinds - popularity, age, game version, category, latest activity, etc</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Automatic download/install</strong></td><td>Automatically install most mods straight from the forum</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Mod managing</strong></td><td>Enable, disable, or remove mods in your mods folder</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Automatic extract/install</strong></td><td>of archives in mods folder for externally sourced mods</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Update checking</strong></td><td>for updates through the forum and VersionChecker data</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Mod profiles</strong></td><td>Save and switch between different sets of mods</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Favorites</strong></td><td>Quickly mark your favourite mods</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dependencies</strong></td><td>Display and quick downloading of installed mods' dependencies</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Keyboard assisted browsing</strong></td><td>Quick paging and categorizing</td></tr></tbody></table><br>As always, updating mods mid-campaign might break your save, check each mod to see if they say it's a breaking change or not.<br><br><strong>Bug reporting</strong>: in-app bug button (opens a channel in the Unofficial Starsector Chat <a href=\"https://discord.gg/a8AWVcPCPr\" class=\"bbc_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> https://discord.gg/a8AWVcPCPr </a>)<br><strong>Discussion</strong>: this forum thread or <a href=\"http://discord://discord.com/channels/187635036525166592/1489644265599537262\" class=\"bbc_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">that same discord channel that's opened when you click the bug button</a><br>Tested on windows, chrome<br><br><span style=\"font-size: 16pt;\" class=\"bbc_size\"><strong>FAQ</strong></span><br><strong>Q</strong>: How does it differ from TriOS?<br><strong>A</strong>: TriOS is primarily a good mod manager, I found myself still using the forum to browse and download mods. QBMBAMM is an all in one modern UI solution for the entire browse to install and manage stack<br><strong>Q</strong>: How do I migrate?<br><strong>A</strong>: It automatically scans your starsector mods folder, you don't really need to do anything<br><br><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 20pt;\" class=\"bbc_size\"><strong>FEATURE SHOWCASE</strong></span><br><iframe width=\"640\" height=\"385\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/474U_iIGYcI?fs=1&amp;start=\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></div><br><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 15pt;\" class=\"bbc_size\"><strong>Sort + Filter</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QtMrUSk.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"1100\" class=\"bbc_img resized\"></div><br><div align=\"center\"><table class=\"bbc_table\"><tbody><tr><td><span style=\"font-size: 15pt;\" class=\"bbc_size\"><strong>1-Click Download &amp; Install</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/37IR74z.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" class=\"bbc_img resized\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 15pt;\" class=\"bbc_size\"><strong>Update Outdated Mods</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5Vaciob.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"bbc_img\"><br></td><td><span style=\"font-size: 15pt;\" class=\"bbc_size\"><strong>1-Button Extract &amp; Install</strong></span> (only needed for manually downloaded zips)<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/E0xKgcy.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" class=\"bbc_img resized\"><br></td></tr><tr><td><br><span style=\"font-size: 15pt;\" class=\"bbc_size\"><strong>Enable / Disable / Delete Mods</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JE8RCYO.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" class=\"bbc_img resized\"><br></td><td><br><span style=\"font-size: 15pt;\" class=\"bbc_size\"><strong>Dependencies Display &amp; Install</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ocprRin.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" class=\"bbc_img resized\"><br></td></tr><tr><td><br><span style=\"font-size: 15pt;\" class=\"bbc_size\"><strong>Mod Profiles</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hjiZdLL.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" class=\"bbc_img resized\"><br></td><td><br><span style=\"font-size: 15pt;\" class=\"bbc_size\"><strong>More From the Same Author</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/p6tTpSQ.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" class=\"bbc_img resized\"><br></td></tr><tr><td><br><span style=\"font-size: 15pt;\" class=\"bbc_size\"><strong>Keyboard Navigation - Pages &amp; Categories</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XyTrcMM.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" class=\"bbc_img resized\"><br></td><td><br><span style=\"font-size: 15pt;\" class=\"bbc_size\"><strong>Keyboard Navigation - Mod Details</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hzmWcXg.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" class=\"bbc_img resized\"><br></td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
